            "value" : "Ergreif die Initiative ohne Grübeln"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go to your home screen, then open Wingman again." : {
      "comment" : "Alert message after picking another app language. The new language applies from the next launch; Wingman quits on its own once the user leaves it, so reopening from the home screen is enough. Shown in the newly picked language.",
