    },
    "Greet neighbors with small talk" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Mit Nachbarn ein bisschen Smalltalk halten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Half of men don't approach. Most who do, succeed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Die Hälfte der Männer spricht niemanden an. Die meisten, die es tun, haben Erfolg."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Her" : {
      "comment" : "Speaker label in a scenario when the woman's name is unknown.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Sie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Home" : {
      "comment" : "Tab bar title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Start"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How did you feel? What happened? Anything you noticed or learned" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wie hast du dich gefühlt? Was ist passiert? Ist dir etwas aufgefallen, hast du etwas gelernt?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How old are you?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wie alt bist du?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I am becoming a guy who takes action." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ich werde zu einem Mann, der handelt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I stopped dreading social situations entirely. That's worth more than any date." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Soziale Situationen machen mir keine Angst mehr. Das ist mehr wert als jedes Date."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I used to freeze up walking past a girl. After 3 weeks I had my first real conversation with a stranger. That was the win." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Früher bin ich erstarrt, wenn ich an einer Frau vorbeiging. Nach 3 Wochen hatte ich mein erstes echtes Gespräch mit einer Fremden. Das war der Durchbruch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I've read every book on this — none of them made me actually do anything. The daily structure changed that." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ich habe jedes Buch dazu gelesen – keins hat mich wirklich ins Handeln gebracht. Die tägliche Struktur hat das geändert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I, %@, am becoming a guy who takes action." : {
      "comment" : "Commitment pledge with the user's first name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ich, %@, werde zu einem Mann, der handelt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IN 1 MONTH" : {
